 ],
 "synopsis": "Blackstone affiliate BCP Asia II Topco sold a 1.55% stake in International Gemological Institute through a block deal valued at ₹280.06 crore. The transaction involved 67.16 lakh shares sold at an average price of ₹417 per share. Domestic and foreign institutional investors, including WhiteOak Capital Mutual Fund, Old Bridge Mutual Fund, Stallion Asset Pvt Ltd, Susquehanna International Group, Ashoka India Equity Investment Trust, Morgan Stanley, and Citigroup Global Markets, acquired the shares. The sale brings the promoter's holding down to 75% from 76.55%, successfully meeting minimum public shareholding requirements under SEBI norms.",
 "ticker": "IGIL.NS",
